  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.3 - Auto Cache Invalidation (January 2026)\n- NEW: Component files automatically reload when modified\n- Cache validates file modification time before use\n- No need to manually clear cache during development\n\nv1.0.2 - Dynamic Param Values\n- Support for {{variable}} syntax in Param values\n- Mixed content interpolation in Param\n- Nested object properties in Param values\n\nv1.0.1 - Documentation Update\n- Comprehensive README and DOCUMENTATION\n\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release\n- Component, Layout, Slot System\n- Enterprise-grade Security\n- High Performance (7,000+ ops/sec)",
